  "about": {
    "description": "Pedro's Tacos & Tequila Bar offers a captivating Mexican-American dining experience that begins the moment you walk through our doors. Immerse yourself in our world of agave and maize, entering a space that evokes the spirit of new-wave Mexico. Our Chicano-inspired ambiance, coupled with our dedication to personalized service, ensures that every visit feels like dining with friends. Indulge in modern Mexican cuisine that honors Mexico's culinary pioneers, blending traditional flavors with innovative artistry. From our taqueria origins, we've committed to sharing our vision of Mexico with every dish we serve.",
    "elevator_pitch": "A vibrant Mexican-American restaurant featuring modern cuisine with authentic flavors and Chicano-inspired ambiance near Perdido Key.",
